					"content": "怎麼樣？您幫我問到意見了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250270502,
					"content": "聽到了這樣的意見…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250270503,
					"content": "將顧客的意見告訴米盧·努伊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250270504,
					"content": "#是、是這樣嗎？謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}，這些意見的確都很有價值，我也會試著調整…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250270505,
					"content": "但是聽客人的口氣…怎麼已經把我的唱片徹底定位成「兒歌」了啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250270506,
					"content": "不行，我必須要做出改變…但是要從哪裡改起呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				}
			]
