					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250271307,
					"content": "雖然過程折騰了一點…但無論如何，這次我都確定了不少可用的聲音素材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250271308,
					"content": "只要做好準備，我就可以正式開始錄製聲音素材了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250271309,
					"content": "唔…就先從「打鬥聲」開始採集吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250271310,
					"content": "…不對，不對！不能從這個開始，還是找點正常的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "米盧·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250271305,
					"content": "普普通通。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250271306,
					"content": "您真是夠謙虛的，我再次感謝您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250271307
